{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_009_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c43ab0fdb091c4c081a91d0e25ca298ea76c3b0510b79aa2500d009aa3e288b0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_009_22:5_02_009_22_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acd598899deeac6af54e55e6ba8f57052c5d6b9642d1cb40a02427f74842bedb",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，稍微方便一下吗？\n我有东西想交给你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_009_22:5_02_009_22_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9123d51530d61834618e403ced1705b8bc895d09b91ce38376c60be60d45f9dd",
      "text": "这个，是情人节的回礼。\n多谢啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_009_22:5_02_009_22_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c5d089c98a33fbfa8779d02841902d61d453b9a3dd0e2811fc507fd1cb326e6",
      "text": "你送我的巧克力，挺好吃的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_009_22:5_02_009_22_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4f6bd47b908a3a3736901228679965a2d18fe96515053744cb42f96d2e08642",
      "text": "你百忙之中为我准备的那份心意，\n要是能哪怕还上几成我也就满足了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_009_22:5_02_009_22_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b7bd3dfa3ddd060af03812cca78034d57c9ee518ec55d928021beb66674601e",
      "text": "我也不知道合不合你的心意，不过……\n总之，回头看看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_009_22:5_02_009_22_b:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ba1e34372a41082d49cb28d1aa05b1accda90bb861bf08daa6484a9e077e3a7",
      "text": "辛苦啦，●●●●プロデューサー。\n回事务所之前方便聊会儿吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_009_22:5_02_009_22_b:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bd6970c95198079f00d6d89a3e5f8fa8d3b3e838bb79f488c2097dc62654698",
      "text": "想着要给你送情人节的回礼。\n收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_009_22:5_02_009_22_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d6deee8ebf103a2d0866756d0b2268e14d8e65965aa50d44e568d98e21b1cb3",
      "text": "因为不习惯这种事，虽然犹豫了挺久，\n不过我也算挑出了自认为不错的东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_009_22:5_02_009_22_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0621a058832f9eff57b1275eb051f437b734004da513f77a6d0e60a5a8d70f31",
      "text": "要是能合你的心意就好了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_009_22:5_02_009_22_b:cmd-000031:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19311eb4b3fff13eb5ee2f47b1b7082aa07d1246aef33de1b036142289e0db2b",
      "text": "比起别的，有这份心意我就最开心了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_009_22:5_02_009_22_b:cmd-000032:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:170ba76cc816566e3e496a036f2e731ff0b2fdf3fafa8d9c6ad3f669e3efb14e",
      "text": "不论收到什么我都绝对会很开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_009_22:5_02_009_22_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1bf6c3fb0dfd193b7bfeef5b8b40c3a5c0c7d5c4149cd907a721e922847d79a",
      "text": "哈哈，你能这么说真是帮了大忙。\n你喜欢就好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_009_22:5_02_009_22_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6b27aad4939ef04644b51f285550ff9632f13cc6d8ffc1f915b2c2496ec15e8",
      "text": "哈哈，居然能让你高兴成这样啊。\n……太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_009_22:5_02_009_22_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e5944a780552b4320c880e78630afa4116b1696a743c87b069ad01cba64c2d7",
      "text": "说起来，差不多该到离开休息室的时间了吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_009_22:5_02_009_22_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27b0b76eacd64a49f03be3931d953b506028cf05149e252c74b35167f0bfb555",
      "text": "礼物等回去之后再拆吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
